# Build-context exclusions for the optional Compose stack — PROD-4 (Story 93).
# Mirrors .gitignore. `.venv/` is the one that matters most: without it the
# build context carries a host-built virtualenv — hundreds of megabytes of the
# wrong platform's binaries — into every image build.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ruff_cache/
staticfiles/
media/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
db.sqlite3
